    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n48185" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Thessălŏnīca</span></b> ,
			ae, or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">-ē</span></b> , ēs, f., =
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Θεσσαλονίκη,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a city of
			Macedonia</i>, <i>on the Sinus Thermaicus</i>, now
				<i>Saloniki</i>, <i><span class="en">Mel. 2, 3,
			1</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 4, 10, 17, § 36</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Cic. Planc.
				41, 99</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id. Q. Fr. 1, 4, 2</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Liv. 39,
				27 al.</span></i> — Hence, <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Thessălŏnīcenses</span></b> ,
				ium, m., <i>the
				inhabitants of Thessalonica</i>, <i><span class="en">Cic. Prov.
				Cons. 2, 4</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id. Pis. 34, 84</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
